{"seq":2,"slug":"sample-size-power","title":"样本量与统计功效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/sample-size-power","wordCount":1558,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"样本量与统计功效\">样本量与统计功效</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>样本量计算（Sample Size Calculation）和统计功效分析（Power Analysis）是实验设计中最关键的定量环节。样本量决定了实验能够检测到多小的效果以及实验需要运行多长时间。样本量不足会导致实验&quot;功效不足&quot;——即使处理确实有效果，实验也大概率检测不到（高假阴性率）；样本量过多则浪费时间和流量，延迟了决策和价值实现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[样本量计算输入] --&gt; B[显著性水平 α]&#10;    A --&gt; C[统计功效 1-β]&#10;    A --&gt; D[最小可检测效应 MDE]&#10;    A --&gt; E[基线指标值]&#10;    A --&gt; F[指标方差]&#10;    B --&gt; G[样本量公式]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[每组样本量 n]&#10;    H --&gt; I[实验时长 = n / 日流量]\">graph TD\n    A[样本量计算输入] --&gt; B[显著性水平 α]\n    A --&gt; C[统计功效 1-β]\n    A --&gt; D[最小可检测效应 MDE]\n    A --&gt; E[基线指标值]\n    A --&gt; F[指标方差]\n    B --&gt; G[样本量公式]\n    C --&gt; G\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[每组样本量 n]\n    H --&gt; I[实验时长 = n / 日流量]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>增大时对样本量的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>α（显著性水平）</td>\n<td>假阳性率上限</td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n<td>减小 α → 增大 n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-β（统计功效）</td>\n<td>真阳性率</td>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>增大功效 → 增大 n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>δ（效应量）</td>\n<td>最小可检测效应</td>\n<td>业务决定</td>\n<td>减小 δ → 大幅增大 n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>σ²（方差）</td>\n<td>指标的波动性</td>\n<td>数据估计</td>\n<td>增大方差 → 增大 n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>k（组数）</td>\n<td>实验分组数量</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>增大 k → 增大 n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比率不均衡</td>\n<td>组间分配不等</td>\n<td>1:1</td>\n<td>偏离 1:1 → 增大 n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>样本量与效应量的关系是平方反比——如果希望检测到原来一半大小的效应，需要四倍的样本量。这个关系使得在小效应场景下，样本量需求会急剧增长，这也是为什么互联网公司的实验平台需要海量用户流量的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"比率指标的样本量计算\">比率指标的样本量计算</h2><p>比率指标（如转化率、点击率、留存率）是 A/B 测试中最常见的指标类型。其样本量计算基于两个比率的差异检验（Z 检验）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from scipy.stats import norm&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def sample_size_proportion(p_control, mde_relative, alpha=0.05, power=0.8,&#10;                            two_sided=True, ratio=1):&#10;    p_treatment = p_control * (1 + mde_relative)&#10;&#10;    z_alpha = norm.ppf(1 - alpha / (2 if two_sided else 1))&#10;    z_beta = norm.ppf(power)&#10;&#10;    p_avg = (p_control + p_treatment) / 2&#10;&#10;    n_control = ((z_alpha * np.sqrt(2 * p_avg * (1 - p_avg)) +&#10;                   z_beta * np.sqrt(p_control * (1 - p_control) +&#10;                                     p_treatment * (1 - p_treatment) / ratio)) /&#10;                  (p_treatment - p_control)) ** 2&#10;&#10;    n_treatment = n_control / ratio&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;n_control&#39;: int(np.ceil(n_control)),&#10;        &#39;n_treatment&#39;: int(np.ceil(n_treatment)),&#10;        &#39;n_total&#39;: int(np.ceil(n_control + n_treatment)),&#10;        &#39;p_control&#39;: p_control,&#10;        &#39;p_treatment&#39;: p_treatment,&#10;        &#39;mde_absolute&#39;: p_treatment - p_control,&#10;        &#39;mde_relative&#39;: mde_relative&#10;    }&#10;&#10;def sample_size_table(p_control, mde_options, power_options=[0.8, 0.9], alpha=0.05):&#10;    results = []&#10;    for mde in mde_options:&#10;        for power in power_options:&#10;            ss = sample_size_proportion(p_control, mde, alpha, power)&#10;            results.append({&#10;                &#39;mde_relative&#39;: f&quot;{mde*100:.1f}%&quot;,&#10;                &#39;power&#39;: f&quot;{power*100:.0f}%&quot;,&#10;                &#39;n_per_group&#39;: ss[&#39;n_control&#39;],&#10;                &#39;n_total&#39;: ss[&#39;n_total&#39;]&#10;            })&#10;    return results\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy.stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sample_size_proportion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_control, mde_relative, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, power</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                            two_sided</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mde_relative)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm.ppf(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> two_sided </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm.ppf(power)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p_avg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (p_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_treatment) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((z_alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_avg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_avg)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                   z_beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(p_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_control) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                     p_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_treatment) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  (p_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_control)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'n_control'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(np.ceil(n_control)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'n_treatment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(np.ceil(n_treatment)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'n_total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(np.ceil(n_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_treatment)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'p_control'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p_control,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'p_treatment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p_treatment,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'mde_absolute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_control,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'mde_relative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: mde_relative</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sample_size_table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_control, mde_options, power_options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><