lor:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">power</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.0f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                'n_per_group'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ss[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'n_control'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                'n_total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ss[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'n_total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实际项目中经常需要进行灵敏度分析，在不同的 MDE 和功效水平下计算样本量，帮助决策者理解&quot;多大的改进可以被多大的样本量检测到&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基线转化率</th>\n<th>MDE（相对）</th>\n<th>功效 80%</th>\n<th>功效 90%</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1%</td>\n<td>+10%</td>\n<td>1,568,000</td>\n<td>2,098,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1%</td>\n<td>+20%</td>\n<td>392,000</td>\n<td>524,500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>+5%</td>\n<td>243,000</td>\n<td>325,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>+10%</td>\n<td>61,000</td>\n<td>81,500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>+5%</td>\n<td>115,200</td>\n<td>154,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>+10%</td>\n<td>28,800</td>\n<td>38,500</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>低基线转化率和小 MDE 的组合会导致天文数字级的样本量需求。对于转化率仅 1% 的场景，检测 5% 的相对提升（即从 1.00% 到 1.05%）需要超过 600 万样本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连续指标的样本量计算\">连续指标的样本量计算</h2><p>连续指标（如人均消费金额、页面停留时长、搜索结果满意度评分）的样本量计算基于两组均值差异的 t 检验。与比率指标不同，连续指标的方差需要从历史数据中估计。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def sample_size_continuous(mean_control, mde_relative, std,&#10;                            alpha=0.05, power=0.8, ratio=1):&#10;    delta = mean_control * mde_relative&#10;&#10;    z_alpha = norm.ppf(1 - alpha / 2)&#10;    z_beta = norm.ppf(power)&#10;&#10;    n_control = ((z_alpha + z_beta) * std / delta) ** 2 * (1 + 1/ratio)&#10;    n_treatment = n_control / ratio&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;n_control&#39;: int(np.ceil(n_control)),&#10;        &#39;n_treatment&#39;: int(np.ceil(n_treatment)),&#10;        &#39;n_total&#39;: int(np.ceil(n_control + n_treatment)),&#10;        &#39;effect_size_cohen_d&#39;: delta / std,&#10;        &#39;mde_absolute&#39;: delta&#10;    }&#10;&#10;def sample_size_with_variance_reduction(mean_control, mde_relative, std,&#10;                                          cuped_r_squared=0.3,&#10;                                          alpha=0.05, power=0.8):&#10;    adjusted_std = std * np.sqrt(1 - cuped_r_squared)&#10;&#10;    original = sample_size_continuous(mean_control, mde_relative, std, alpha, power)&#10;    reduced = sample_size_continuous(mean_control, mde_relative, adjusted_std, alpha, power)&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;original_n&#39;: original[&#39;n_total&#39;],&#10;        &#39;reduced_n&#39;: reduced[&#39;n_total&#39;],&#10;        &#39;reduction_ratio&#39;: 1 - reduced[&#39;n_total&#39;] / original[&#39;n_total&#39;],&#10;        &#39;cuped_r_squared&#39;: cuped_r_squared,&#10;        &#39;original_std&#39;: std,&#10;        &#39;adjusted_std&#39;: adjusted_std&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sample_size_continuous</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mean_control, mde_relative, std,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                            alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, power</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    delta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mde_relative</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm.ppf(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z_beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm.ppf(power)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((z_alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_beta) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ratio)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_treatment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_control </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color