\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                          cuped_r_squared</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                          alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, power</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    adjusted_std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cuped_r_squared)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    original </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample_size_continuous(mean_control, mde_relative, std, alpha, power)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reduced </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample_size_continuous(mean_control, mde_relative, adjusted_std, alpha, power)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'original_n'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: original[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'n_total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'reduced_n'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: reduced[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'n_total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'reduction_ratio'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reduced[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'n_total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> original[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'n_total'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'cuped_r_squared'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: cuped_r_squared,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'original_std'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: std,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'adjusted_std'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: adjusted_std</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>连续指标往往具有高方差和偏态分布特征。人均消费金额的分布通常是右偏的（少数高消费用户拉高方差），这导致样本量需求大幅增加。方差缩减技术（如 CUPED）通过利用实验前的协变量信息降低指标方差，从而在不增加样本量的情况下提升统计功效。</p>\n<p>CUPED（Controlled-experiment Using Pre-Experiment Data）是微软提出的方差缩减方法，它利用用户在实验前的历史行为数据作为协变量，通过线性回归去除指标中可被实验前数据解释的方差部分。如果实验前数据能解释 30% 的方差（R² = 0.3），则等效样本量提升约 43%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多重比较校正\">多重比较校正</h2><p>当一个实验检验多个指标或多个变体时，每个检验都有 α 的假阳性概率。随着检验次数增加，至少一个假阳性的概率急剧上升——检验 20 个指标时，即使所有处理都无效，也有 64% 的概率至少看到一个&quot;显著&quot;结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def bonferroni_correction(p_values, alpha=0.05):&#10;    m = len(p_values)&#10;    adjusted_alpha = alpha / m&#10;&#10;    results = []&#10;    for i, p in enumerate(p_values):&#10;        results.append({&#10;            &#39;original_p&#39;: p,&#10;            &#39;adjusted_threshold&#39;: adjusted_alpha,&#10;            &#39;significant&#39;: p &lt; adjusted_alpha&#10;        })&#10;    return results&#10;&#10;def benjamini_hochberg(p_values, alpha=0.05):&#10;    m = len(p_values)&#10;    sorted_indices = np.argsort(p_values)&#10;    sorted_pvalues = np.array(p_values)[sorted_indices]&#10;&#10;    adjusted = np.zeros(m)&#10;    for i in range(m):&#10;        adjusted[i] = sorted_pvalues[i] * m / (i + 1)&#10;&#10;    for i in range(m - 2, -1, -1):&#10;        adjusted[i] = min(adjusted[i], adjusted[i + 1])&#10;&#10;    adjusted = np.minimum(adjusted, 1.0)&#10;&#10;    results = np.zeros(m)&#10;    results[sorted_indices] = adjusted&#10;&#10;    return [{&#39;original_p&#39;: p, &#39;adjusted_p&#39;: adj, &#39;significant&#39;: adj &lt; alpha}&#10;            for p, adj in zip(p_values, results)]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bonferroni_correction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_values, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    adjusted_alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_values):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results.append({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'original_p'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'adjusted_threshold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: adjusted_alpha,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'significant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adjusted_alpha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> benjamini_hochberg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_values, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sorted_indices </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argsort(p_values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sorted_pvalues </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array(p_values)[sorted_indices]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    adjusted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(m):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        adjusted[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sorted_pvalues[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        adjusted[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(adjusted[i], adjusted[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    adjusted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.minimum(adjusted, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(m)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results[sorted_indices] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adjusted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'original_p'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: p, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'adjusted_p'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: adj, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'significant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: adj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p, adj </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_values, results)]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Bonferroni 校正是最保守的方法，将显著性阈值除以检验次数。它严格控制了族错误率（Family-Wise Error Rate），但代价是大幅降低统计功效。Benjamini-Hochberg 程序控制的是错误发现率（False Discovery Rate），在允许一定比例假阳性的前提下保持更高的统计功效，更适合探索性分析场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校正方法</th>\n<th>控制目标</th>\n<th>保守程度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不校正</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>最宽松</td>\n<td>仅 1 个主指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bonferroni</td>\n<td>FWER</td>\n<td>最保守</td>\n<td>少量关键指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Holm-Bonferroni</td>\n<td>FWER</td>\n<td>较保守</td>\n<td>少量指标，需更高功效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Benjamini-Hochberg</td>\n<td>FDR</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>多指标探索性分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层策略</td>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>主+次+护栏分层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实验时长与周期效应\">实验时长与周期效应</h2><p>实验时长的确定不能仅基于样本量除以日流量，还必须考虑业务周期效应。用户行为在工作日和周末、月初和月末、节假日前后存在显著差异。如果实验只覆盖工作日不覆盖周末，结论可能对周末用户不适用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def calculate_experiment_duration(n_total, daily_traffic,&#10;                                    traffic_fraction=1.0,&#10;                                    min_weeks=2, max_weeks=8):&#10;    daily_eligible = daily_traffic * traffic_fraction&#10;&#10;    min_days = int(np.ceil(n_total / daily_eligible))&#10;&#10;    min_days_with_weeks = max(min_days, min_weeks * 7)&#10;&#10;    recommended_days = int(np.ceil(min_days_with_weeks / 7) * 7)&#10;&#10;    recommended_days = min(recommended_days, max_weeks * 7)&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &#39;minimum_days&#39;: min_days,&#10;        &#39;recommended_days&#39;: recommended_days,&#10;        &#39;recommended_weeks&#39;: recommended_days // 7,&#10;        &#39;daily_eligible_users&#39;: daily_eligible,&#10;        &#39;total_users_collected&#39;: daily_eligible * recommended_days,&#10;        &#39;overcollection_ratio&#39;: daily_eligible * recommended_days / n_total&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculate_experiment_duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_total, daily_traffic,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                    traffic_fraction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                    min_weeks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, max_weeks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    daily_eligible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_traffic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> traffic_fraction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    min_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(np.ceil(n_total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_eligible))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    min_days_with_weeks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(min_days, min_weeks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    recommended_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(np.ceil(min_days_with_weeks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    recommended_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(recommended_days, max_weeks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'minimum_days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: min_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'recommended_days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: recommended_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'recommended_weeks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: recommended_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'daily_eligible_users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: daily_eligible,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'total_users_collected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: daily_eligible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recommended_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'overcollection_ratio'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: daily_eligible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recommended_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>经验法则是实验至少运行两个完整的业务周期。对于大多数互联网产品，一个完整周期是一周（包含工作日和周末），因此最低运行时长为两周。对于月度付费产品或具有月度周期的场景，最低时长可能需要两个月。新奇效应（Novelty Effect）和学习效应（Primacy Effect）也要求实验运行足够长时间以消除这些初始偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>样本量与效应量呈平方反比关系，检测小效应需要指数级增长的样本量</li>\n<li>比率指标的样本量取决于基线转化率和 MDE，低转化率场景需要大量样本</li>\n<li>连续指标的方差估计来自历史数据，CUPED 等方差缩减技术可等效增加 30-50% 的样本量</li>\n<li>多重比较校正是多指标/多变体实验的必备步骤，BH 程序在功效和错误控制之间取得平衡</li>\n<li>实验时长必须覆盖完整的业务周期，最低两周是大多数互联网产品的经验底线</li>\n<li>功效分析应在实验设计阶段完成，实验结束后的&quot;事后功效分析&quot;在统计上没有意义</li>\n<li>灵敏度表格帮助决策者直观理解&quot;样本量-效应量-功效&quot;之间的三角权衡关系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"样本量与统计功效","id":"样本量与统计功效"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"比率指标的样本量计算","id":"比率指标的样本量计算"},{"level":2,"text":"连续指标的样本量计算","id":"连续指标的样本量计算"},{"level":2,"text":"多重比较校正","id":"多重比较校正"},{"level":2,"text":"实验时长与周期效应","id":"实验时长与周期效应"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实验设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/experiment-design-principles"},"next":{"title":"随机化方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/randomization-methods"}}